\item[* task:] Making an NP (with 'head/DETP') out of a DETP + EN 
(the EN referring to 'human beings' or 'non-human beings' 
\item[\ \ strategy:] (also: deviations from accepted proposals)
\item[\ \ rejected alternatives:]
Velen, allen, etc. included in the lexicon as NP's.
\item[\ \ clarification of variables:]
Clarification of MATCHCONDITIONS:
\begin{enumerate}
\item I1: The head of the DETP has to be a DET (not a NUM, DEMADJ, ART or QP)
\item I2: The head of the CN has to be an EN
